invariant: INV-41
file: src/rsa_mont.c
catches: rsa_avx2_model_test
reason: divide_by_power_of_two drops the carry out of the sum's top word,
  so the quotient's top word loses the bits of x + u m above 2^(64k), and
  the chain starts from a power that is not sig 2^(Dn) mod m.
  bin/rsa_avx2_model_test compares rsa_vp1_cpu under CH_CPU_AVX2 with
  rsa_vp1 at every word count.

--- old
    sum[k] = carry;
--- new
    sum[k] = 0;
